st-XML/issues/1836","id":1433853618,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85Vdt6y","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-02-16T23:01:34Z","updated_at":"2023-02-16T23:08:10Z","body":"@jlovejoy it is not included in Fedora - it is a package that has been proposed for Fedora. I believe it has not yet been approved for inclusion in Fedora based on technical criteria and it has not yet been approved for inclusion in Fedora based on legal criteria. In all likelihood if it is *not* approved for Fedora, it won't be because of this license, but I think that is all we can say. I believe it may already be in Debian though but I'm not sure :)\r\n\r\n It is also possible that this license is in some other package currently in Fedora, but currently we have no information about that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1433853618/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"e